#. +> trunk stable
#: kthememanager.cpp:63 kthememanager.cpp:69
msgid "This control module handles installing, removing and creating visual KDE themes."
msgstr "Mit dit Kuntrullmoduul kannst Du KDE-Mustern installeren, wegdoon un opstellen."

